    "created_at": "2022-03-11T17:18:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-11T17:18:03Z",
    "body": "That kind of archaeology isn't well supported without using `git blame` or `git log --grep`. https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/review-drafts/ and https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/ can help somewhat perhaps, but I'm not too keen to advertise those more prominently.\r\n\r\nAlso generally we don't consider something to be compliant if it doesn't match the currently published specification.",
