    "updated_at": "2022-03-11T18:39:40Z",
    "body": "that's a useful attitude for evergreen browsers, but unfortunately the world still hasn't caught up to that (even if it's slowly moving in that direction). There are several \"before we moved to a living standard\" spec versions with official URLs that can be added as \"previous versions\" so folks can at the very least find the (now legacy, but still important) DOM v1, v2, etc.",
